<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Food Waster Dashboard</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css" />
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-sans">

    <header class="bg-white shadow-md p-4 flex justify-between items-center slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">Food Waster</h1>
        <nav class="space-x-6 font-semibold">
            <a href="/" class="text-green-600 border-b-2 border-green-600 pb-1">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/upload" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-green-600 transition">Upload</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="p-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-700">Dashboard Analytics</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-blue-500 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                <h3 class="text-gray-500 font-medium">Customers</h3>
                <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">1,248</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-green-500 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
                <h3 class="text-gray-500 font-medium">Sales</h3>
                <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">$42.5k</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-yellow-500 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
                <h3 class="text-gray-500 font-medium">Potential Waste Prevented</h3>
                <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">340 lbs</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-purple-500 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
                <h3 class="text-gray-500 font-medium">Total Items Sold</h3>
                <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">8,932</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Charts and Order Section -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Stacked Charts -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
                <!-- Bar Chart: Sales per Category -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.7s;">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-gray-700">Sales per Category</h3>
                    <div class="relative h-64 w-full">
                        <canvas id="categoryChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Line Chart: Projected Sales -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-gray-700">Projected Sales</h3>
                    <div class="relative h-64 w-full">
                        <canvas id="projectedChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column: What to order -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up flex flex-col" style="animation-delay: 0.9s;">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 text-gray-700 border-b pb-2">What to order</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Expected quantities needed based on sales</p>
                
                <ul class="space-y-4 flex-grow" id="order-list">
                    <!-- This will be populated by JavaScript to match the bar chart -->
                </ul>
                
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t">
                        <button id="generate-report-btn" class="w-full bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition shadow-md">
                            Generate Order Report
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 1.0s;">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800 flex items-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
                Important Things to Note (Upcoming Events)
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 list-disc list-inside">
                <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Impending Winter Storm (Friday):</strong> Anticipate panic buying. Ensure high stock of milk, bread, eggs, and bottled water.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Upcoming Thanksgiving Holiday:</strong> High demand expected for turkeys, cranberries, and baking supplies. Recommend increasing meat stock by 30%.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Local Farmer's Market (Weekend):</strong> Expect a slight drop in organic produce sales; consider adjusting weekend pricing to compete.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Custom JS to render charts -->
    <script src="/scripts/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>